WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
The seeds came in an envelope with no return address.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
By Tuesday they had sprouted. By Wednesday, they were arguing.

3
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
"Left," said the fern. "Towards the window," said the moss.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Plants are not supposed to have opinions about furniture.

5
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.000
These ones had opinions about everything.

6
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Shh. They grow faster when nobody talks.
